docs {
  Technician Contention Test:
  Customer 4 specifically requests Technician 1 (Alex Nguyen) at 2026-11-20T09:00:00Z.
  Since Tech 1 is already committed to Customer 1's appointment, the server must reject with HTTP 409 Conflict:
  "Requested technician is unavailable for this time window."
